    "document": "SRD 5.2.1",
    "review": "C1-03 wave 2 — spells that needed new tracked-effect vocabulary: AC bonus/floor, damage defenses, d20 bonus dice, attack-hit damage riders, and modifier-only temporary HP. Each executionScope states what the runtime enforces."
  },
